@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed — Logical retirement, policy assessment and physical deletion
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Receive explicit authorized lifecycle/erasure request;
:Determine actual source policy, affected data classes and obligations;
if (Logical retirement / trash permitted?) then (yes)
 :Record attributable lifecycle state; do not imply physical reclamation;
else (no)
 :Report actual denied / unresolved-policy disposition;
 stop
endif
:Assess all active and provisional consumer/history references;
if (Safe physical deletion permitted under actual obligations?) then (yes)
 :Acquire exclusive claim that excludes new reference admission;
 :Recheck current eligibility / version / reference state;
 :Observe actual backend deletion and record partial/unknown accurately;
 :Credit only confirmed applicable reclaimed capacity;
else (no)
 :Retain necessary protection; record actual limitation / next disposition;
endif
:Handle replicas/caches/backups under actual reviewed lifecycle procedure;
stop

@enduml
